Z||000040||Terrybogin||03-12-2000||08:09 PM||||Go home 454. Good luck in your quest of finding a 14 second dependable daily driver that gets 30 MPG for $1000. If you find one, go ahead and buy another one for me.<BR>Think about the question you asked and where you asked it. Did you think that 800+ people that come here would tell you to buy a Mustang? Why dont you go over to one of the mustang forums and ask that same question to see what kind of results you get. If you went to a Yugo forum, people there would tell you to buy a Yugo. Think about it. Most everyone that replied to you did so in a respectable manner. Try that at the mustang forum and see what you get. Go ahead and buy your dream car. In at least 12 years, see if it has the following that the Fiero has now. Keep in mind how much the 84-88 Mustangs were POS's before you think too hard about that. Now, good luck in your quest.||||reg||1
